    {
      "text": "flaming sword which turned every way, Gen. 3:24 (Moses 4:31). I will bring a sword upon you, Lev. 26:25. sword without, and terror within, shall destroy, Deut. 32:25. a man … with his sword drawn, Josh. 5:13. drave them out … but not with thy sword, Josh. 24:12. sword of the Lord, and of Gideon, Judg. 7:20. they got not the land in possession by their own sword, Ps. 44:3. their tongue a sharp sword, Ps. 57:4. Let the high praises of God be … a twoedged sword, Ps. 149:6. beat their swords into plowshares, Isa. 2:4 (Micah 4:3; 2 Ne. 12:4). Lord with his … strong sword shall punish leviathan, Isa. 27:1. my sword shall be bathed in heaven, Isa. 34:5 (D&C 1:13). he hath made my mouth like a sharp sword, Isa. 49:2. by his sword will the Lord plead with all flesh, Isa. 66:16. sword of the Lord shall devour from the one end, Jer. 12:12. judgments upon Jerusalem, the sword, Ezek. 14:21. they that are in the wastes shall fall by the sword, Ezek. 33:27. Beat your plowshares into swords, Joel 3:10.",
